The vmm-dsdt.asl file is the source for /etc/firmware/vmm.dsdt.

Build and validate it with ACPICA iasl:

	iasl -we -tc -p vmm-dsdt vmm-dsdt.asl
	iasl -d vmm-dsdt.aml
	iasl -we -tc vmm-dsdt.dsl

Install vmm-dsdt.aml as /etc/firmware/vmm.dsdt.  vmd loads the table at
guest physical address 0xa1000 and references it from the FADT.
